5,1,1,talk,George,,I think we should be thorough. I'm interested in how others handle this. Let's look at the facts first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We need a clear picture of the actual time and effort spent on this arrangement.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the daily reliability of the car. I want to know the actual state of its usage.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to understand what a truly fair split looks like. We should check the financial records.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how much we really spend. It feels like we are just guessing, right?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, guessing is exactly what we must avoid. I'll look into the external examples to see where others fail.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will focus on the time spent. The diary and the recurring trips should reveal the pattern.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I think the mechanic's notes and the handover state are important. The car's condition affects everyone's morning.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the tax and insurance papers. We need to know the fixed costs before discussing the variable ones.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I want to see the fuel receipts and the hours in the diary. I want to see the real numbers.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
