60,3,1,talk,George,,Option B seems the most peaceful. It removes the need to ask for favors or check figures constantly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the most efficient. It eliminates the evening negotiations and the stress of recurring trip conflicts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option B provides predictability. I would know exactly when the car is mine and in what state it should be.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the most fair financially, but Option B is much simpler to manage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A uses the real numbers, which I like. But Option B sounds more peaceful for everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, simplicity often prevents the ""souring"" I'm worried about. Let's prioritize the relationship over the cents.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, the time we spend untangling who owes what is a hidden cost. Option B removes that entirely.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"If we go with B, we must still agree on a standard for how the car is left for the next person.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with George. While A is mathematically fair, the social cost of tracking every kilometer is too high.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,"If everyone likes Option B, then I like it too. I don't want to argue about money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,I believe we have found a consensus. Option B protects our friendship and our sanity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is the most logical choice to minimize administrative waste and scheduling friction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"As long as we commit to the car's maintenance and cleanliness, Option B is my preference.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I will vote for B. It's a reasonable compromise between absolute fairness and practical living.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for B too. It seems like the kindest way to do it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
